---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About | NewFavorite">
  <div class="wrap article about">
    <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT</p>
    <h1>About NewFavorite</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Recipes, ingredient guides, and cooking techniques for home cooks.
    </p>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        There’s something familiar about returning to recipes we know. And
        sometimes, trying an unfamiliar ingredient, experimenting with a
        technique, or discovering an unexpected combination can make cooking
        feel fresh again.
      </p>
      <p>
        NewFavorite shares recipes and approachable ideas to trying something new. 
        Not every experiment needs to be elaborate. Sometimes a small change is
        enough to find a new favorite.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img
      class="article-hero"
      src="/images/hero.png"
      alt="A table set with colorful food to share"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
  </div>
</Base>
